cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MeshPress/STRIDE, please cite the article below."
title: "MeshPress: STRIDE GPU mesh compression"
abstract: >-
  MeshPress is the reference implementation of STRIDE (STRIp-walked
  Triangulated Residual Integer Decoder), a per-meshlet self-contained mesh
  compression format designed for per-frame GPU decompression, together with
  the benchmark harness and reproducibility scripts for the accompanying
  article in The Visual Computer.
